# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Node (only used ad hoc for browser tests)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GENERATED ARTIFACTS — never committed.
#
# Every tenant corpus, logo and config is produced deterministically by
# `python -m pipeline.build_tenants` and regenerated by CI on every push.
# Committing them would put ~640 files under version control that no human
# edits, and make every registry change produce an unreadable diff.
#
# The source of truth is tenants/registry.yml plus the domain packs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tenants/*/docs/
tenants/*/fabric/
tenants/*/brand/
tenants/*/tenant.json
tenants/*/questions.json
tenants/registry.json

# Generated by build_site on every run
site/index.html
site/kit/
site/demo/
site/data/
site/.nojekyll

# Regenerated from brand-assets/ by build_brand_assets on every CI run.
# Committed too, so a plain checkout can serve site/ without running the
# pipeline — CI output simply overwrites them.
# (site/assets/brand/*.png)

# Hand-written and committed, never written or deleted by the pipeline:
# site/assets/, site/walkthrough/, site/deck/, site/downloads/.
